  "D3_basis": "the verdict is taken at the conservative (central) supply reading; the optimistic (most extreme single seed) reading is published beside it and the rows it adds are named",
  "D4_reach": "a widening row is reached iff flip <= cap; shortfall = flip / cap, so a factor above 1 is the widening still missing",
  "D5_ceiling": "the family ceiling is read off the source summary AND asserted equal to the widest published arm top, so 'one ceiling' is measured",
  "D6_scope": "the question is widening reach above the ceiling; the narrowing instrument's reach is published for the below-floor card and no verdict is taken on it here",
